# Therap Services

> Therap Services is the #1 industry leading Electronic Health Record (EHR) and documentation software platform designed specifically for human services agencies, particularly those serving individuals with Intellectual and Developmental Disabilities (I/DD), Long-Term Services and Supports (LTSS), and Home and Community Based Services (HCBS). It streamlines case notes, medication administration, goal tracking, electronic visit verification (EVV), audit-ready reporting, and billing into a unified HIPAA-compliant workflow aligned with HIPAA, Medicaid, and state-specific regulations. Therap is used by 15,000+ Providers across all 50 states, as well as 20+ State Government agencies.

Website: https://www.therapservices.net/

