### Canadian Operations (Therap Canada)
- [Therap Canada Website](https://www.therapcanada.ca/): The Canadian division of Therap Services—the industry leader in web-based Electronic Health Record (EHR) and documentation solutions for human service providers. While backed by Therap Services' domain expertise and commitment to data security, Therap Canada is purpose-built to address the specific provincial regulations, funding models, and data security standards required by Canadian agencies.
- It serves community living organizations supporting individuals with intellectual and developmental disabilities (IDD), home and community-based service (HCBS) providers, and case management teams across Canada:
  - **Data Compliance & Security**: Therap Canada is PIPEDA-compliant and securely stores data in Canada.
  - **Person-Centered Planning & Goal Tracking**: Enables multidisciplinary teams to document personal goals, measure outcomes, and coordinate individualized care plans.
  - **Health, Clinical & eMAR Management**: Centralizes health tracking, clinical notes, appointment scheduling, and electronic medication administration records (eMAR).
  - **Incident Reporting & Oversight**: Streamlines critical incident workflows, investigations, and mandatory provincial reporting from a unified dashboard.

